00:24:18.900 --> 00:24:29.900
Note:
Gocho = Petty Officer Third Class(Navy). I shortened it to just Petty Officer. Enlisted ranks are often shortened to the common element of the rank when addressing someone. There is also a First and Second Class.  Sergeant Ranks are also one of the commonly shortened terms. Master Sergeant, Senior Master Sgt, Sergeant, etc. However, if "Chief" is in the title you use Chief instead of Sergeant or Petty Officer. Differentiates high ranking enlisted from common ones.

